ness_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants, Seafood","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Cajun/Creole, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants, Southern","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"kdqoDMuvyNedsouc1i33vQ","name":"Araña Taqueria y Cantina","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"RGXb-3iUuaORNWB_nt_RcQ","review_id":"XiTGWxoy4uDhvIAYWa3jJg","date":"2019-10-21T01:58:58","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9386351108551025,"text_excerpt":"Came here on Sunday night. I think I messed up the reservation because they didn't have us down...but the wait was only about 15mins, so that wasn't bad! Got the bayou old fashioned and it was pretty good. Well crafted indeed. Probably would want it a bit more sweet slightly for my taste, but it was a solid choice Started with the chargrilled oysters. First time having oysters really and they were delicious. The crunchy bread they come with, paired with the oyster was an amazing combination. Then had the creole catfish. Wow...just wow. The catfish was simply divine. And the sausage and shrimp creole with rice that came with it was amazing. Great portion size too that we had to take some l..."},{"business_id":"RGXb-3iUuaORNWB_nt_RcQ","review_id":"u0IzL4_zzdw32a5C3SQnBg","date":"2017-03-23T15:03:25","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9368315935134888,"text_excerpt":"Galliano was really good!! When I found out this was the new, casual sister restaurant of Rebirth, which I love, I knew I had to try it out. I was looking for a restaurant that specialized in Cajun/Creole food in particular because my boyfriend and I wanted to take a friend there who lives out of town and doesn't get to eat Southern food often. I made a reservation the day before through Open Table and I'm glad I did because it was crowded for a Wednesday night, especially for a place so new. I would describe the ambiance as trendy but dress code is casual and I saw plenty of people in jeans and t shirts. Galliano is actually next to Rebirth and where the restaurant Root used to be. When ..."},{"business_id":"RGXb-3iUuaORNWB_nt_RcQ","review_id":"DC0iImeWWpPfubUnzK7OpA","date":"2017-03-18T22:38:10","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9328577518463135,"text_excerpt":"We really enjoyed our meal, and the restaurant. First impression - really nice open dining room. We walked in with no reservation, they were busy, and we were still seated very promptly. Good drinks. Friendly service. It was nice to go to an upscale neighborhood restaurant away from the Quarter and the tourists. Food was very good - the double pork chop with andouille sausage is among the most ridiculous things I've ever ever eaten. One comment I made to my wife sums up the restaurant - \"I bet the locals being their out-of-town visiting friends here\". Great place."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"RGXb-3iUuaORNWB_nt_RcQ","photo_id":"nhwmO22gU6OYLqmJEq0a1Q","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/nhwmO22gU6OYLqmJEq0a1Q.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8964439630508423},{"business_id":"RGXb-3iUuaORNWB_nt_RcQ","photo_id":"GebyUyz0Wkuudmzok9dWUw","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/GebyUyz0Wkuudmzok9dWUw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8948086500167847},{"business_id":"RGXb-3iUuaORNWB_nt_RcQ","photo_id":"Al4YTm7Y6oIhUn8i_b5LLg","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/Al4YTm7Y6oIhUn8i_b5LLg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8515626192092896},{"business_id":